            <_.fcp.TableDescription.true...table-description>
              <formatted-text>
                <run>Shows revenue for each completed month, based on delivered items marked Complete. Includes order counts, average order value, growth comparisons and rolling revenue trends. Each row represents one month. The current month is excluded. Values may change as the source data updates.</run>
